    { id: "park", title: "A little room for everyone.", seal: "DUCKTOPIA APPROVED", body: "The orbital ministry became a public park. Every duck got a pond. Every pond got a bench. The button is now a very popular, slightly nervous roundabout." },
    { id: "president", title: "The button was the protagonist.", seal: "PRESIDENT BUTTON", body: "It started as a button. You gave it a career, a civilisation, and a pension. Its first presidential act is to shorten meetings to one satisfying squeak." },
    { id: "pond", title: "Everything is pond now.", seal: "REALITY REZONED", body: "The universe was successfully converted into a duck pond. Galaxies are breadcrumbs. Time is a gentle ripple. The planning permission is still pending." }
